screen.LIGHTING=Lighting
screen.LIGHTING.comment=How bright the sky, torches and glowing blocks are.
screen.RAYTRACING=Path Tracing & Shadows
screen.RAYTRACING.comment=Shadows, sunlight, sky light, bounced light and block light, all traced through the world.
screen.WATER=Water
screen.WATER.comment=3D waves and ripples, foam, refraction, caustics and clarity.
screen.SNOW_PLANTS=Snow & Plants
screen.SNOW_PLANTS.comment=3D snow and the tracks pressed into it; plants that wave in the wind and bend when you walk through them.
screen.MATERIALS=Materials & Reflections
screen.MATERIALS.comment=Resource pack PBR, reflections, wet surfaces and puddles.
screen.ATMOSPHERE=Atmosphere & Clouds
screen.ATMOSPHERE.comment=God rays, fog and the cloud layers.
screen.SKY=Sky
screen.SKY.comment=Stars, aurora, rainbows, halos, eclipses and other sky events.
screen.CAMERA=Camera & Image
screen.CAMERA.comment=Exposure, colour, bloom and anti-aliasing.
screen.EFFECTS=Lens & Effects
screen.EFFECTS.comment=Vignette, lens flare, rain and water on the lens, depth of field, motion blur, the curved planet.
screen.GAMEPLAY=Gameplay
screen.GAMEPLAY.comment=Flashlight, spawn warning, health effects, zoom.
profile.LOW=Low
profile.MEDIUM=Medium
